What exactly do you want to test? If you want to use the entire same test on different architectures you can set the check prefix

```rust
//@ revisions: x86 aarch64

//@[x86] compile-flags: --target x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu
//@[x86] filecheck-flags: --check-prefix CHECK-X86

//@[aarch64] compile-flags: --target aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu
//@[aarch64] filecheck-flags: --check-prefix CHECK-AARCH64
